This standalone script adapts the transport, deferred-callback, startup
synchronization and readback architecture of lg-therma-v-pro-em50_vc.shelly.js
published in drHouse-gif/lg-therma-v-shelly and ALLTERCO/shelly-script-examples.
The Midea register handling, fresh masked writes, nine-component layout,
non-destructive provisioning and test harness were added for this solution.

The register data was cross-checked against the R32 profile maintained in
Mosibi/Midea-heat-pump-ESPHome and the 171H120F device configuration in
timlaing/modbus_local_gateway. Technical references are listed in
TECHNICAL_NOTES.md. No manufacturer endorsement is implied.

